TechMart Device Diagnostic Procedures:
- Error E-305 (Cloud Sync Timeout): Clear app cache, hold power button for 10 seconds to force hard reset.
- Error E-102 (Earbud Pairing Failure): Place SoundBuds Ultra in charging case, hold back button for 7 seconds until LED pulses white.
- Error E-401 (Power Cycle Lockup): Disconnect AC adapter, wait 15 seconds, hold Power + Volume Down for 8 seconds.
